{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S10的感受意象切换过密，从清风、夏夜跳到蛛丝、细雨、飞瀑，画面略显堆叠，不如Y集中自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮的关键短语迅速标出了人物每一阶段的心理支点，观众即使边听边扫，也更容易抓住他为什么靠近、为什么退缩、为什么重新放松，以及后来为什么不再隐藏喜欢。感受词缩小并按音乐节点出现，既减少同时阅读的负担，又把情绪变化落实到呼吸、身体、声线、光线和音乐运动上，细腻程度明显胜过Y较多依赖静态短词罗列的方式。两版的故事因果和整体推进基本一致，因此整体连贯性不判明显胜负。</escape>\"\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "73c39b4f-05c3-40e0-8f5c-a5a3b159dac8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010242587481Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:04:06.401138+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c90775fb8c2958457ad3b04cccfcf9697a23f1b2c5a9bdac1a03a664574e6a50", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_